      "side": 1,
      "message": "Regardless of the validation action, we still need the rule to generate the exportable api file even if it is not within the critical path of a build target, as failing to do so leads to a missing build rule error or a NPE. Apart from the validation action, there are [some modules](https://cs.android.com/search?q\u003d%22%7B.exportable%22%20f:.bp) that depend on the exportable api file \\ removed api file, which will fail to build when `WITHOUT_CHECK_API\u003dtrue`.\n\n\u003e we should atleast have a mechanism that raises an exception for sdk builds if `WITHOUT_CHECK_API` is true.\n\nAgreed. Created https://r.android.com/3003853 to address this.",
